# Records written by a hand run stay local. The anchors matter: the scheduled
# job stores under data/, which is committed on purpose — that history is the
# only copy of traffic older than the fourteen days GitHub retains.
#
# Raw snapshots carry contributor, author and fork-owner logins, so committing
# them is a decision about this repository's visibility — PRODUCTION_PLAN.md 7.3.
/snapshots/
/classified/
/series/
*.json.tmp

# The published page is docs/index.html. A second rendered copy in git
# only ever goes stale against it.
/dashboard.html
